<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id" />
  <para style="h">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Samuel</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Israel yoba King ta nono sugl morabe digwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Ana Samuel kidagl yogwa igne, ye wam suo Israel yoba jasno morabredi dedugwa. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Ye wam komono, kagie Joel we digwa. Te, ye wam okuo kagie Abiya we digwa. Samuel ye jas morabredi dedugo, ye dumo Berseba mogl, yoba kotno pribrika. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Ye kot pribrika ba ye neno Samuel mabuno wakai boglmere boglkre, mige pre eribrika. Yegl eribrika pre yoba ye kotno win sinamnedi jas suo i kuduno eriko, ye mige i nedre, kot wakai prikribrika.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Ana Samuel wam suo yegl eribrika pre Israel yagl kade mudu makai sidre, ede pi Samuel dumo Rama moglmara eigwa. <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" />Samuel moglmara pidre, ye yegl di teigwa, Ene pro! Ene kidagl yengo, ene wan suo ene mabuno wakai boglnere boglkribrika. Yegl pre ene yagl swara ta dedin, ye king tau kantri mudu sugl meglmere yegl no sugl morabiwe di yegl digwa. <verse eid="1SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Yegl digo, Samuel ye king ta no sugl morabiwe digwa i kide prukwa. Ye kide prisre, siragl mere erabuka i pragledi Yawe agle di prukwa. <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />Ye Yawe agle di pruko, Yawe di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ye ene di teigwa i, eratniwa. Ye ene mokono tekrikwa. Na swara ye kingno moglka i, ye kide prisre, mokono narimiwe di, Yawe yegl dugwa.<verse eid="1SA 8:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />Ana Samuel ere mogl, yagl ta kagie Sol we digwa i, yegl di togwa, Yawe Murubuglomo ene motnara udre, ene yobuglo tenabuka. Tenan, ene ka kep yoba bogl akie ka kep yebi, ene u yagl pere mere yegl pi moratniwe dugwa.<verse eid="1SA 10:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Samuel ere mogl, yagl ta Sol we digwa i king morabe dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Ana Samuel ere mogl, Israel yoba yegl di togwa, Nono ede dumo Gilgal we dimara pidre, aglke kor Sol nono kingno morabe dinamniwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Yegl dugo, Israel yoba mudu ede dumo Gilgal pidre, Yawe gumuglo wagle Sol nono kingno moglmiwe digwa. Didre, ye Yawe bogl deno muduno swara yenamnedi tawa teigo, Sol ya Israel yoba mudu gun podo yeigwa.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s">God king kor ta morabedi paduglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Ana Samuel ere mogl, Sol di te, Ene du etniwe! dugwa. Yawe, ene Godnen moglkwa i, ene ka di tomere duglo boglkitnga. Ene duglo boglna, Yawe ene wan ya gawanma aimadi kamin Israel kingno moraiglmedi edugo. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" />Ba erme we, ene ya ene wan ya gawanma king ta moglkraiglkwa. Yawe ene ka di tomere ene duglo boglkitnga pre ye yagl ta ye mabuno wakai kanumere duglo boglkwa i doko kandre, ye Israel yoba kingno morabedi padigl kodumiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="1SA 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Samuel ye Devit king morabedi kugo nuglo bre mina toide edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Samuel annoints David" file="FM 115 Samuel Anoints David_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="16.1" />Ana Yawe ere mogl, Samuel yegl di togwa, Ene den mudn yubun dogo, Sol mirie goglnga i, kodo! Na ye Israel yoba kingno okuo ta moglkrabedi mane diga. Yegl pre ene sipsip kumugl bre yobuglo yenga i mina kugo nuglo koglsre, ede dumo Betlehem pi, yagl ta kagie Jesi we digwa i moglmara enatnga. Na ye wam ta na kogonana ersre, king morabedi kere ie di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="1SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Yegl dugo, Samuel di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na siragl mere enagle? Na kugo nuglo Jesi wam ta bre mina toide edenagledi ebo, Sol prisre, na na si gorabiwe dugwa. Dugo, Yawe ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene kau abai ta idre, ede enatniwa. Ene pidre, yoba di te, Na Yawe tawa tenagledi ede wie di, yegl dinatnga. <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Te, ene tawa naratnara Jesi akie enabugledi di gagln, ye wama bogl ebi, na ye wam ta ene obuno di tenaglka. Na ene obuno di tebo, ene wam i king morabedi kugo nuglo bre mina toide edinatniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="1SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Ana Yawe ka yegl dugo, Samuel ye dumere ere, ede dumo Betlehem ogwa. Ye ogo, yagl kade dumo i meglkwa kudugl goglsre, ogono nagino nuglo didre, ye umara tegigl yenamnedi pi, Samuel yegl di prikwa, Ene no kipamnara unga i we, no ere kide ere noragledi uno mo ere wakai ere noragledi une? di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="1SA 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Yegl digo, Samuel di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na ene ere kide ere tenagledi ukrika. Yawe tawa tenagledi wiga. Enene ake kun ersre, na tawa tenaglmara ede wio! di, yegl dugwa. Yegl didre, ye ama Jesi wama bogl yene ake kun eraiglmedi di tedre, Na tawa tenaglmara ede wio! dugwa.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Ana Jesi wama bogl ede pi Samuel tawa tenabara eigo, akie meglkwa. Akie meglko, Samuel Jesi wam ta kagie Eliap we digwa i kandre, Jesi wam Yawe gumuglo wagle adigl moglkwa i, Yawe kere yugwa pamiwe di, yegl di prukwa. <verse eid="1SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Yegl di prukwa ba Yawe ere mogl, Samuel yegl di togwa, Yagl i yagl olto moglkwa i ya wakai moglmedi kanga i prikro! Na ye king morabuka mane diga. Ene yoba ere mogl, yoba siragl mere meglkwa i pre yubu simere yegl na ta erekrika. Ene kan ogono gagno keme edigwa ba na we, na kan ye nomano ya deno mudno ime edie dugwa. <verse eid="1SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Yegl dugo, Jesi ye wam ta kagie Abinadap di togo, ye Samuel gumamugl wogwa. Wogo, Samuel yegl dugwa, Yawe ene wan i ama kere ikrume dugwa. <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Yegl dugo, Jesi ye wam ta kagie Sama di togo, ye Samuel gumamugl wogwa. Wogo, Samuel aglke kor dugwa, Yawe ene wan i ama kere ikrume dugwa. <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Dugo, Jesi wam 4-pela yoko meglkwa i swara swarade di togo, ye swara swarade Samuel gumamugl weigwa. Swara swarade weigo, Samuel ye Jesi di te, Yawe ene wanma i ama kere ikrume dugwa. <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Yegl didre, Samuel Jesi di pre, Ene wan ta ama moglmo? dugwa. Dugo, Jesi di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na wana okuo kaima ta ukrukwa. Ye sipsipna sugl moglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. Jesi yegl dugo, Samuel aglke kor dugwa, Ene yoba ta dedin, ye agre yunabiwa. Nono ye pre sugl moramga. Ye unan, nono ame di, kaya mokna nenamniwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="1SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Samuel yegl dugo, Jesi yoba ta dedugo, ye pi, agre i ede ugwa. Ana Jesi wam okuo i nagie gogl mere koglsre, ogo nagie ya guma dra wakai koglkwa pre yoba ye wakai kanigwa. Ye ugo, Samuel ye kanugo, Yawe ye di te, yegl dugwa, Kumugl i pre diga. Ene ye moglmara pi, kugo nuglo yunga i ye king morabedi bre mina toide edo! dugwa. <verse eid="1SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Yegl dugo, Jesi wam Devit we digwa i agiglema bogl akie adigl meglko, Samuel kugo nuglo sipsip kumugl bre yogagle mina kogl yugwa i ye bre mina toide edugwa. Ye kugo nuglo toide edidre, aglke ede ikne dumo Rama ogwa. Ana Devit we, Samuel ye kugo nuglo bre mina edugwa igne i Yawe Murubuglomo ye moglmara udre, yobuglo togwa. Te, Yawe Murubuglomo ye Devit moglmara kide kodokre, aimadi ye moglmara moglkwa.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Ana Sol we, Yawe Murubuglomo ye moglmara kide kodugo, Yawe ere mogl, murubuglo kide ta ye moglmara pi, ye nomanemo ere kide ere tenan, Sol kudugl podo gorabedi ere edugwa.<verse eid="1SA 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
</usx>